WEBVTT

00:00:02.335 --> 00:00:05.326
We can edit news posts in multiple ways.

00:00:06.536 --> 00:00:10.199
First way is to use the context menu.

00:00:10.216 --> 00:00:13.510
Pretty much anywhere
the news item shows up to say,

00:00:13.510 --> 00:00:16.517
Edit news.

00:00:16.786 --> 00:00:19.038
We could do it there for the home
highlights.

00:00:19.038 --> 00:00:21.508
We can do it from

00:00:21.508 --> 00:00:24.516
the news list here.

00:00:25.524 --> 00:00:29.456
The other way to do it is to navigate

00:00:29.456 --> 00:00:32.447
to the actual news item.

00:00:34.212 --> 00:00:37.219
And click the edit tab.

00:00:40.211 --> 00:00:41.504
To edit this news item.

00:00:41.504 --> 00:00:45.285
I'm going to show you, a new feature,
or at least a feature

00:00:45.285 --> 00:00:47.369
that's easier to use now.

00:00:47.369 --> 00:00:51.049
In the new version of the sites
and let's adding pictures and media.

00:00:52.242 --> 00:00:55.351
So instead of being a two step process
like it used to be,

00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:58.795
we can just go here to the insert
media icon.

00:00:59.988 --> 00:01:05.147
And here we're going to have all the
images and documents from the site. Well

00:01:06.172 --> 00:01:07.163
images.

00:01:07.163 --> 00:01:10.155
And then there's a tab for documents.

00:01:11.801 --> 00:01:14.439
We can choose an existing image here.

00:01:14.439 --> 00:01:16.725
I like this image of my dog.

00:01:16.725 --> 00:01:20.506
Or we can select a new file

00:01:20.506 --> 00:01:23.513
like an image of both my dogs.

00:01:27.261 --> 00:01:28.756
And this

00:01:28.756 --> 00:01:31.159
target of text that I'm putting in here
is very important.

00:01:31.159 --> 00:01:34.940
It allows
people is what a screen reader will read.

00:01:35.192 --> 00:01:38.183
To people who have,

00:01:38.183 --> 00:01:42.132
you know, vision difficulties
or any kind of disability

00:01:42.132 --> 00:01:45.476
that, doesn't allow them to,
you know, access

00:01:45.476 --> 00:01:48.467
the picture.

00:01:48.702 --> 00:01:49.811
So would you want to have that?

00:01:49.811 --> 00:01:53.357
You know, that alternative text
should describe what is in the picture.

00:02:01.691 --> 00:02:04.346
Now we also have another new feature
called New revisions.

00:02:04.346 --> 00:02:07.337
You can ignore completely ignore this
if you want to.

00:02:07.623 --> 00:02:10.883
It's going to create a new revision
every time you edit,

00:02:11.084 --> 00:02:12.462
something on the website.

00:02:14.731 --> 00:02:15.974
If we click save,

00:02:15.974 --> 00:02:18.982
we can see there's our image.

00:02:19.553 --> 00:02:22.544
We can also go look through the revisions
and say, okay,

00:02:22.544 --> 00:02:25.855
I want the one before I added the image

00:02:25.855 --> 00:02:28.846
so I could revert to that.

00:02:31.131 --> 00:02:32.022
I want to view it.

00:02:32.022 --> 00:02:32.711
The image is gone.
